@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowFontSize 16
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
hide footbox
autonumber
title Sequence view · UC-1 reserves a key before direct upload\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/api/uploads.py#L18
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/services/direct_intake.py#L99
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/services/storage.py#L42
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
skinparam maxMessageSize 350
actor owner as C $CLIENT
participant "api.uploads\n«module»" as A $MEDIA
participant "direct_intake\n«module»" as I $MEDIA
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
participant "storage: Storage" as S $MEDIA
collections "source: S3" as B $INFRA
C -> A : POST /uploads/reservations (request JSON)
activate A
A -> I : reserve(s,storage,user.id,request)
activate I
group Media reservation transaction
 I -> DB : SQL: owner/request lookup; add/flush row if absent; COMMIT
end
opt pending, unexpired, matching request hash
 I -> S : direct_upload_grant(row)
 activate S
 S --> I : upload: dict (method/url/fields)
 deactivate S
end
I --> A : reservation dict (upload=None if finalized)
deactivate I
A --> C : HTTP 201 response
deactivate A
opt upload grant returned
 C -> B : POST exact staging key
 B --> C : upload response
end
legend bottom
Hash conflict raises 409; expired pending row raises 410. IntegrityError re-reads the winning row.
POST length range is 1..declared size; finalize enforces exact size/hash. Max 100 MiB; expiry 15 minutes.
endlegend
@enduml
